insert into passages (title,body,"wordCount",difficulty,topic,status) values ('Sleep and Memory', 'Sleep is not merely a period of rest. During sleep, the brain strengthens some memories and weakens others, helping people retain what is important. Students who sacrifice sleep for extra study time may gain a few hours of review but lose some of the benefit of that review. Effective preparation therefore requires both practice and recovery. The discussion is framed around a realistic situation in which readers must distinguish the central claim from tempting but exaggerated conclusions.', 77, 7, 'sleep and memory', 'approved');
